OL,3,GNEWSAPlastic recycling centre plans
OL,4,Anarrowly approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a new plastics recycling
OL,7,Fplant in Worksop have narrowly been
OL,8,Fapproved, despite more than 1,200
OL,9,Fresidents signing a petition against
OL,10,Fit.
OL,12,FEnvale UK tabled plans for the plant,
OL,13,Fwith an energy recovery facility, on an
OL,14,Fold recycling site off Shireoaks Road.
OL,16,FNottinghamshire County Council's
OL,17,Fplanning committee gave the plans the
OL,18,Fgo-ahead on Tuesday, with six members
OL,19,Fin favour of the scheme and five
OL,20,Fagainst.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
